WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:01.588
How many totients are there?

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:06.785
Values of Euler's phi function: no odd number above one appears.

3
00:00:06.935 --> 00:00:10.039
Ford found the growth order; Erdős and Hall asked for more.

4
00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:14.857
Claimed: an asymptotic formula, up to a bounded wobble.

5
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:17.132
Lean: main theorem.
